MODULE: OptOutReplays
TARGET: OptOutSilent
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: leaf re-replay ignores the AutoRemediateOnDigestMismatch opt-out
PERTURBS: ReReplay

--- FIND
    /\ ~optOut
    /\ ~Blocking
    /\ consumed < Budget
    /\ ~WalTrimmed
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~Blocking
    /\ consumed < Budget
    /\ ~WalTrimmed
--- END
